# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `RandomMeas.jl` to draw 2,048 Haar-random measurement settings and sample 256 shots from each, then split the settings evenly into training and testing sets. Split by setting rather than by shot: shots from the same setting share its rotations, so they are not independent.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `RandomMeas.jl` untuk mencabut 2,048 tetapan pengukuran rawak Haar dan mensampel 256 tembakan daripada setiap satu, kemudian bahagikan tetapan secara sama rata kepada set latihan dan ujian. Bahagikan mengikut tetapan dan bukan mengikut tembakan: tembakan daripada tetapan yang sama berkongsi putarannya, jadi ia tidak bebas.\n"

